This is a minor update for the game, thanks to your feedback!



Patch Change List:

- Added the ability to remap keys for PC in the game settings;

- Changed player switching in manual mode (previously, the nearest player was selected, but sometimes the nearest = current);

- Changed player turning speed from 5 to 15;

- Released a corrected official layout for the XBOX 360 gamepad, where, when selected in the game, gamepad button icons are displayed in the interface.



You can submit your suggestions for improving the game or report any bugs you find in the game’s Community. We will definitely review and try to implement your requests!

This is a small update for the demo version of the game, thanks to your feedback!

List of Patch changes:
- AI Improvements;
- Fixed a bug related to weather conditions;
- Fixed a bug where the Space key would trigger the pause menu;
- Minor changes to game mechanics;
- Changes to Russian localization;
- Fixing minor bugs in UI.

You can tell us your suggestions on improving the game or bugs you found in the Community of the game. We will definitely consider and try to realize your wishes!
